<office:body><office:text><text:p text:style-name="J">1. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 1.1. (see UC-1.1 and QR-G.1).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">2. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 2.2. (see UC-2.1 and QR-G.2).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">3. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 3.3. (see UC-3.1 and QR-G.3).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">4. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 4.4. (see UC-4.1 and QR-G.4).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">5. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 5.5. (see UC-5.1 and QR-G.5).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">6. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 6.6. (see UC-6.1 and QR-G.6).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">7. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 7.7. (see UC-7.1 and QR-G.7).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">8. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 8.8. (see UC-8.1 and QR-G.8).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">9. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 9.9. (see UC-9.1 and QR-G.9).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">10. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 10.10. (see UC-10.1 and QR-G.10).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">11. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 11.11. (see UC-11.1 and QR-G.11).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="J">12. The coordinator must approve the payment request within three working days; otherwise the request is cancelled automatically and the student is notified by e-mail. Efficient office workflow: final ﬁle, ﬂow and eﬃcient handling of Öğrenci İşleri, İstanbul Şişli, ağır çalışma. Interoperability requirements, internationalization considerations and responsibilities are described in section 12.12. (see UC-12.1 and QR-G.12).</text:p><table:table table:name="T"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="3"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Item</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Value</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Unit</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:ta